{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-1e8e59b9e765","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-1e8e59b9e765","name":"肉饼炖蛋","category":"meat_dish","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/meat_dish/%E8%82%89%E9%A5%BC%E7%82%96%E8%9B%8B.md","blob_sha":"957998f3d733a8d957d96103c149c231c27309ec","details":{"introduction":"肉饼炖蛋是一道咸鲜滑嫩的传统家常菜，肉饼吸饱了酱汁，鸡蛋卧在其中，口感软嫩又下饭。它富含优质蛋白质和多种氨基酸，能很好地补充体力。做法十分简单，对厨房新手非常友好，从备料到出锅大约只需要 20 分钟。","difficulty":"★★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 猪肉末\n- 鸡蛋\n- 料酒\n- 生抽\n- 白胡椒粉\n- 芝麻香油"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"- 猪肉末 300g\n- 鸡蛋 2 个\n- 料酒 10ml\n- 生抽 20ml\n- 白胡椒粉 5g\n- 芝麻香油 10-15ml"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 在碗中加入猪肉末、料酒、生抽、白胡椒粉、鸡蛋和芝麻香油，搅拌均匀。\n2. 将调好味的猪肉末铺在盘子里，肉末中间用勺子挖一个洞，往洞中打入 1 个鸡蛋。\n3. 锅中加水至 1/4 高度，水烧开后，将盘子放入锅中，盖上锅盖，蒸 15 分钟。"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 在取出肉饼炖蛋时，注意盘子很烫，请小心操作。"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：生猪肉末300g、净全鸡蛋液100g、通用酱油（shoyu近似）20g、芝麻香油10g、黑胡椒粉2g；整份约430g。无料酒家庭版，黑胡椒代白胡椒，肉汁全部食用。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":240.934884,"protein_g":15.147907,"carbohydrate_g":0.694419,"fat_g":19.369581},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167902/nutrients","version":"c3d7bb7bdc190a3b","fdc_ids":[167902,171287,174277,171016,170931]},"profile_id":"family-1e8e59b9e765-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-1e8e59b9e765","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-1e8e59b9e765","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"covered_steaming","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":true,"brand":null,"variant":"family-1e8e59b9e765-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"pork_ground","grams":300},{"key":"egg","grams":100},{"key":"soy","grams":20},{"key"